Third-party work that ships inside Nibble keeps its own terms:

* Icon path data — Lucide (ISC) and Simple Icons (CC0). See Icons-LICENSE.txt.
* Silkscreen typeface — SIL Open Font License 1.1. See Silkscreen-OFL.txt.
* Monocraft typeface (the Minecraft-style theme) — SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  See Monocraft-OFL.txt.
* The rendering engine is not bundled: Nibble drives the Microsoft Edge WebView2
  Runtime that Windows already provides, under Microsoft's terms.

That is everything: Nibble's own source is MIT, and nothing else is bundled with it.
